Settings description
__________________________________________________________________

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Settings|
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Settings|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting1|
 The number of potatoes will define how many inputs (=potatoes) the box has
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting1|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting2|
 The ID of the stimulation to be sent when the beginning of a artifact is detected
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting2|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting3|
 The ID of the stimulation to be sent when the end of a artifact is detected
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting3|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting4|
 The speed of adaptation of the potato field [0 , 1]. The lower the value, the slower the adaptation.
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting4|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting5|
 The threshold p-value for artifact detection
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting5|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting6|
 The name of the trained field file to be used as the potato field initial state
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting6|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting7|
 The name of the file to which the potato field final state will be written (optionnal)
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoField_Setting7|
